FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains an appropriation of $38,100,000 from the PUBLIC SCHOOL FOUNDATION
PROGRAM ACCOUNT (SFP) to the State Construction Department. This bill contains an
appropriation of $5,500,000 from the SFP to the Department of Education - School
Finance.
